 I am fearfully and wonderfully made. I am."

449
00:27:28,000 --> 00:27:34,000
 So I'm saying that to you. Fast forward now, 10 years later, I'm in my mother's kitchen.

450
00:27:34,000 --> 00:27:40,000
 There's no S.E.U. band in the kitchen.

451
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:44,000
 There's four archangels did not come down and, you know, do a river dance on my duvet.

452
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:48,000
 There was nobody else there. It was just my mom's kitchen.

453
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:54,000
 But because I had been renewing my mind for that decade, what came out of me as my mom's weeping,

454
00:27:54,000 --> 00:27:58,000
 imagine this traumatic moment, it's everything you're imagining and worse.

455
00:27:58,000 --> 00:28:02,000
 My mother was just so broken, and I just jumped and I grabbed her and I went,

456
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:05,000
 "Mom, it's okay." This is what came out of me.

457
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:09,000
 I said, "Mom, it's okay, because before I was formed in my mother's womb."

458
00:28:09,000 --> 00:28:12,000
 Whose ever womb that was. God knew me.

459
00:28:12,000 --> 00:28:17,000
 He knitted together my innermost parts and he fashioned all of my days before as yet there was one of them.

460
00:28:17,000 --> 00:28:20,000
 And guys, that day every fact that I thought to be true about my life changed.

461
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:23,000
 What my background was, what my name was, all of it changed.

462
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:28,000
 And to this night, I don't know the circumstances surrounding my conception.

463
00:28:28,000 --> 00:28:33,000
 I don't know if I was a result of a one night stand, some ongoing adulterous affair,

464
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:35,000
 or even if I was a result of a rape.

465
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:39,000
 But although I don't know the facts, I do know there's a force on the planet much higher than the facts,

466
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:41,000
 and it's called the truth of the Word of God.

467
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:46,000
 And Ephesians chapter 2 verse 10 does not say that I am the workmanship of a rape.

468
00:28:46,000 --> 00:28:49,000
 It doesn't say that I am the workmanship of an adulterous affair.

469
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:57,000
 It says that I am God's workmanship, recreated in Christ Jesus for good works that God prepared beforehand.

470
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:00,000
 That I should walk in them.

471
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:04,000
 And wouldn't it be just like God to take my birth certificate, doesn't have a name on it,

472
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:09,000
 it's a child's name, unnamed, number 2508 of 1966.

473
00:29:09,000 --> 00:29:14,000
 Wouldn't it be just like God to take an unnamed, unwanted, abused, adopted chick

474
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:18,000
 from the back of Sydney, Australia, and say, "Not only am I going to rescue you,

475
00:29:18,000 --> 00:29:23,000
 but I'm going to use you to open up the prison doors for those that are still bound in slavery

476
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:25,000
 and still bound in life."

477
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:27,000
 Wouldn't it be just like God?

478
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:30,000
 And let me tell you, every time we put a trafficker in jail,

479
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:32,000
 and every time we rescue a young woman or child,

480
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:35,000
 I think, "Devil, you could stick that in your pipe and smoke it."

481
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:37,000
 I bet you wish you left me alone.

482
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:41,000
 I feel like Joseph who looked at his brothers in Genesis chapter 50 verse 20,

483
00:29:41,000 --> 00:29:46,000
 and he said, "You meant this evil against me, but God meant it for this very purpose,

484
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:49,000
 to save many people alive."

485
00:29:49,000 --> 00:29:53,000
 So when I came to faith in Christ, as you can tell, I was broken.

486
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:58,000
 I was messed up, so all I could be was a servant.

487
00:29:58,000 --> 00:30:02,000
 But it seems to me that that's what God uses.

488
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:05,000
 So this is my whole call to ministry.

489
00:30:05,000 --> 00:30:08,000
 "Christine, how did you do it?

490
00:30:08,000 --> 00:30:10,000
 I mean, did you build a brand? Here you go."

491
00:30:10,000 --> 00:30:13,000
 There was no internet. I'm as old as when the dinosaurs roamed the earth, guys.

492
00:30:13,000 --> 00:30:16,000
 So, no, I wasn't brand building.

493
00:30:16,000 --> 00:30:18,000
 There was no internet.

494
00:30:18,000 --> 00:30:21,000
 There was no social media. This is like old school.

495
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:22,000
 You had to trust God.

496
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:24,000
 So this is what happened.

497
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:28,000
 I went to the young adults meeting, and the young adults pastor said,

498
00:30:28,000 --> 00:30:31,000
 "We're having a church cleanup day on Tuesday. I want you to hear this.

499
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:33,000
 This is exactly how it happened.

500
00:30:33,000 --> 00:30:35,000
 We're having a church cleanup day."

501
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:39,000
 So because I had just gotten saved, I thought, "That's what you did."

502
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:44,000
 I didn't, in my day, there was no one for me to look at.

503
00:30:44,000 --> 00:30:46,000
 There was no internet.

504
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:49,000
 I wasn't scrolling through everybody else's life.

505
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:52,000
 I was busy living my own life.

506
00:30:52,000 --> 00:30:55,000
 See, what we do is scroll through everyone else's,

507
00:30:55,000 --> 00:30:57,000
 and then we sit down and tell God what we like.

508
00:30:57,000 --> 00:30:59,000
 "Oh, I'd like to do that for you. That looks awesome."

509
00:30:59,000 --> 00:31:03,000
 But see, if you come with no agenda, this is what I've discovered God can use.

510
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:06,000
 So it was like, "Okay, I'm a Christian now. This is my church.

511
00:31:06,000 --> 00:31:09,000
 I'm going to go to the church cleanup day. I just think this is what you do."

512
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:13,000
 Well, I was the only one from that young adults ministry that went.

513
00:31:13,000 --> 00:31:15,000
 So I went to the church cleanup day, and I'm cleaning.

514
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:17,000
 And so the assistant youth pastor comes down and said,

515
00:31:17,000 --> 00:31:20,000
 "You're Christine Kariofalos, aren't you?"

516
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:23,000
 Because Nick thinks he's rescued me, but I like my other name.

517
00:31:23,000 --> 00:31:27,000
 "You're Christine Kariofalos, aren't you?"

518
00:31:27,000 --> 00:31:30,000
 I said, "Yeah." He goes, "You're doing psychology at uni, aren't you?"

519
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:32,000
 And I was doing English and economic history,

520
00:31:32,000 --> 00:31:35,000
 so basically I can read golden books and count to three.

521
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:39,000
 And so I was like, "You know, I've got a minor in psych, but it's not my major."

522
00:31:39,000 --> 00:31:43,000
 He goes, "Well, anyway, I'm going on a missions trip with a senior pastor for six weeks,

523
00:31:43,000 --> 00:31:46,000
 and we just got a grant for a youth center."

524
00:31:46,000 --> 00:31:48,000
 To which I said, "What's a youth center?"

525
00:31:48,000 --> 00:31:53,000
 He said, "I don't know, but we got a grant, and so do you want to help out?"

526
00:31:53,000 --> 00:31:55,000
 Did I pray? No.

527
00:31:55,000 --> 00:32:01,000
 Did I have a 40-day fasting and a water fast? No, no.

528
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:03,000
 Did I even know what youth ministry was? No.

529
00:32:03,000 --> 00:32:05,000
 Did I know what a youth center was? No.

530
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:09,000
 But I had said, "Here I am."

531
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:12,000
 That's all I'd said. "Here I am."

532
00:32:12,000 --> 00:32:15,000
 So it was like, "Okay, okay."

533
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:17,000
 Well, for the sake of time, I'll fast forward.

534
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:20,000
 That became, and to this day it still exists,

535
00:32:20,000 --> 00:32:24,000
 one of the most largest and influential youth centers in Australia.

536
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:29,000
 Did I know then that God was actually training me?

537
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:33,000
 Today we run probably the largest anti-trafficking organization in the world,

538
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:38,000
 but where do you think I learned to deal with governments and to deal with councils

539
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:42,000
 and to deal with business peoples and the education department and the hospitals

540
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:44,000
 and to deal with churches and to deal with...

541
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:45,000
 Where do you think that learned?

542
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:51,000
 See, other people went, "Well, no, no. I'm called to do this."

543
00:32:51,000 --> 00:32:55,000
 Now, thank God I didn't limit myself to what I thought I was called to do

544
00:32:55,000 --> 00:32:58,000
 because I didn't know human trafficking existed in 1990

545
00:32:58,000 --> 00:33:00,000
 when I was building the youth center that I'd never prayed for,

546
00:33:00,000 --> 00:33:03,000
 but that's what we needed to serve at a church.

547
00:33:03,000 --> 00:33:08,000
 People would say communication and speaking is definitely one of my primary gifts.

548
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:15,000
 I never even did this on any kind of platform for years.

549
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:19,000
 I'm not talking about for years because what was needed was

550
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:23,000
 who's got volunteers to go and work in the schools?

551
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:25,000
 But where do you think I learned to speak?

552
00:33:25,000 --> 00:33:27,000
 Talking to you is easy. You're nice Christians.

553
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:31,000
 You should speak to 1,500 unsaved teenage boys in an Australian high school.

554
00:33:31,000 --> 00:33:33,000
 That's where you learn to speak.

555
00:33:33,000 --> 00:33:36,000
 When I'll be at Passion in a couple of months in that big baseball stadium,

556
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:43,000
 that's easy compared to 1,500 Catholic boys in an Australian high school.

557
00:33:43,000 --> 00:33:47,000
 Did I know then that for nearly a decade God was training me?

558
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:49,000
 Anonymity, obscurity.

559
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:52,000
 But you see, here's the deal. I thought I'd arrive then.

560
00:33:52,000 --> 00:33:54,000
 I didn't know there was anywhere else to go because I was in Christ,

561
00:33:54,000 --> 00:33:56,000
 so I'd already arrived.

562
00:33:56,000 --> 00:33:58,000
 And so then once you know you've already arrived,

563
00:33:58,000 --> 00:34:00,000
 then it's how can I serve? Where's a need?

564
00:34:00,000 --> 00:34:03,000
 People are like, "Well, find a need and meet it."

565
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:05,000
 So my youth pastor would say, "We need to do this."

566
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:07,000
 I never even asked, "Is this part of my gift mix?

567
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:10,000
 Is this my strength finder? Is this my Enneagram number?

568
00:34:10,000 --> 00:34:12,000
 Is this my love language?"

569
00:34:12,000 --> 00:34:14,000
 We write Christian books to excuse Christians from being Christians.

570
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:17,000
 There is only one love language, "Die to self."

571
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:20,000
 That's the Christian love language, seriously.

572
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:22,000
 And that's where God will use you.

573
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:25,000
 That's where God will use you.

574
00:34:25,000 --> 00:34:27,000
 And then it went from that.

575
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:32,000
 And then when my pastor wanted someone to run our state youth movement,

576
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:36,000
 and these were big rallies in stadiums like you see at Passion Now.

577
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:40,000
 Well, I was in the back of high schools and I was doing the youth center.

578
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:44,000
 And then my pastor said, "Christine, I want you to do that."

579
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:47,000
 There was no way you could market yourself.

580
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:50,000
 So I was so busy in the prayer closet getting marked by God,

581
00:34:50,000 --> 00:34:53,000
 I never needed to market myself.

582
00:34:53,000 --> 00:34:56,000
 And if we had a generation that understood why do we have altars?

583
00:34:56,000 --> 00:34:59,000
 Why do we say, "God, I'll go anywhere, I'll do anything,"

584
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,000
 without an agenda?

585
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:05,000
 But Lord, your agenda alone, because God marks you.

586
00:35:05,000 --> 00:35:10,000
 And when God marks you, no amount of marketing can do what God can do.

587
00:35:10,000 --> 00:35:12,000
 One marking from God.

588
00:35:12,000 --> 00:35:15,000
 Listen, if God has assigned you, God will find you.

589
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:18,000
 God created you, He doesn't need to discover you.

590
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:22,000
 It doesn't matter how much you go, "Well, as if God doesn't know that I'm here."

591
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:24,000
 He knows exactly where you are.

592
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:27,000
 But the issue is that you being the servant that He's called you to be.

593
00:35:27,000 --> 00:35:32,000
 Because He came and found Joshua exactly where Joshua was.

594
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:37,000
 Joshua wasn't out saying, "Moses is dead, now pick me."

595
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:41,000
 When Samuel was going to anoint a new king,

596
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:45,000
 the Lord came to Samuel and said, "I have chosen for myself a king."

597
00:35:45,000 --> 00:35:47,000
 And sent him to the house of Jesse.

598
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:50,000
 Where was David? In the back of the field.

599
00:35:50,000 --> 00:35:52,000
 We're so scared.

600
00:35:52,000 --> 00:35:54,000
 So scared that God might miss us.

601
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:57,000
 That we're all so busy branding ourselves out there,

602
00:35:57,000 --> 00:35:59,000
 marketing ourselves out there,

603
00:35:59,000 --> 00:36:04,000
 and we're not on an altar on our face asking God to use us in anonymity, in obscurity.

604
00:36:04,000 --> 00:36:07,000
 And then when God's ready to use us, He'll come and find us.

605
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:09,000
 Because He knows where we are.

606
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:12,000
 Moses was in the backside of the desert, tending his father-in-law's sheep,

607
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,000
 and a burning bush came.

608
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:17,000
 God came to him in a burning bush.

609
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:19,000
 God will find you wherever you are.

610
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:22,000
 But if you're out chasing something,

611
00:36:22,000 --> 00:36:24,000
 the Lord's going to go to the place that He assigned you,

612
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:27,000
 not the place where you want to be.

613
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:30,000
 He came to David in the back of the field.

614
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:33,000
 He came to Joshua in this place.

615
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:37,000
 And so the issue is, He could say to, "Hey Joshua, get ready.

616
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:38,000
 It's time to go in."

617
00:36:38,000 --> 00:36:40,000
 Why could He say to Joshua, "Get ready"?

618
00:36:40,000 --> 00:36:43,000
 Because Joshua was already ready.

619
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:44,000
 Joshua was already ready.

620
00:36:44,000 --> 00:36:47,000
 Why? He turns up on the pages of, look what it says,

621
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:52,000
 Joshua, Moses' assistant.

622
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:55,000
 Not out there trying to become the top.

623
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:59,000
 He was Moses' assistant for years.

624
00:36:59,000 --> 00:37:05,000
 In Exodus 33, when Moses is in the tent of meeting with the Lord,

625
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:09,000
 Joshua, Exodus 33, 11, is lingering.

626
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,000
 Lingering.

627
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:13,000
 Can you imagine what he must have heard?

628
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:15,000
 The conversations with God he may have.

629
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:18,000
 Who knows? It's not in the text, but he may have overheard.

630
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:21,000
 But he was definitely in that proximity.

631
00:37:21,000 --> 00:37:25,000
 He saw, because he accompanied Joshua,

632
00:37:25,000 --> 00:37:31,000
 accompanied Moses before Moses went up Mount Sinai to get the Ten Commandments.

633
00:37:31,000 --> 00:37:34,000
 Imagine the leadership lessons he learned.

634
00:37:34,000 --> 00:37:36,000
 Being the assistant.

635
00:37:36,000 --> 00:37:38,000
 But see, we all want to be the star.

636
00:37:38,000 --> 00:37:41,000
 No one wants to be anyone's assistant anymore.

637
00:37:41,000 --> 00:37:43,000
 Nobody wants to serve anymore.

638
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:50,000
 And then we're wondering how we're going to fulfill the purpose that God has for us.

639
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:57,000
 He appears in this text as Moses' assistant.

640
00:37:57,000 --> 00:38:04,000
 Moses appears in the text as God's servant.

641
00:38:04,000 --> 00:38:10,000
 What is the heart that we need to see the revival that we so long to see?

642
00:38:10,000 --> 00:38:12,000
 A heart of servanthood?

643
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:18,000
 A willingness to be an assistant in anonymity and obscurity?

644
00:38:18,000 --> 00:38:21,000
 So that when God says, "Get ready," you're ready.

645
00:38:21,000 --> 00:38:28,000
 So I'm 10 years in a youth centre, so I was ready when my pastor said, "Now get ready."

646
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:33,000
 All those 20 years that led up to that before A21,

647
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:39,000
 were me getting ready for what God had already had ready for me.

648
00:38:39,000 --> 00:38:44,000
 But we don't want to go step by step.

649
00:38:44,000 --> 00:38:48,000
 The Scripture says the steps of a righteous person are ordered by the Lord.

650
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:50,000
 There is no elevator to the top.

651
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:53,000
 Steps, steps.

652
00:38:53,000 --> 00:38:56,000
 So we start where we are,

653
00:38:56,000 --> 00:39:00,000
 with a posture that says, "I just want to be a servant.

654
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:03,000
 I'm not coming to you with my agenda."

655
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:07,000
 Because we're so infiltrated with the Spirit of Babylon,

656
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:10,000
 the world that we're living in that says, "You build your best life now.

657
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:12,000
 You put yourself out there now.

658
00:39:12,000 --> 00:39:14,000
 You tell God what you want to do now."

659
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:18,000
 And the Lord's going, "I'm just looking for some servants.

660
00:39:18,000 --> 00:39:20,000
 That's all I'm looking for.

661
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:25,000
 With no agenda but my agenda.

662
00:39:25,000 --> 00:39:28,000
 Not using me to build their brand.

663
00:39:28,000 --> 00:39:30,000
 Not using me to build their career.

664
00:39:30,000 --> 00:39:34,000
 Just no other agenda but my agenda."

665
00:39:34,000 --> 00:39:37,000
 Oh, we'd see revival.

666
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:40,000
 We would.

667
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:42,000
 If we were willing to be servants.

668
00:39:42,000 --> 00:39:46,000
 If we were willing to be assistants.

669
00:39:46,000 --> 00:39:50,000
 As for me, I'm just glad I'm in the room.

670
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:55,000
 See, because I remember what it was like to not be in Christ

671
00:39:55,000 --> 00:39:59,000
 and not be involved in the purpose of God.

672
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:03,000
 And I just thank God that I'm anywhere in His purpose.

673
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:07,000
 I just thank God that He would even include me in it

674
00:40:07,000 --> 00:40:11,000
 rather than telling Him this is the only thing I want to do.

675
00:40:11,000 --> 00:40:14,000
 We all want to be Christian influencers online

676
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:19,000
 and no one wants to be a Christian offline.

677
00:40:19,000 --> 00:40:25,000
 And if we were willing to be the real deal,

678
00:40:25,000 --> 00:40:30,000
 I don't think there's any limit to what God will do.

679
00:40:30,000 --> 00:40:35,000
 You know, the fact is a whole generation missed it.

680
00:40:35,000 --> 00:40:38,000
 And I think, this is just my opinion,

681
00:40:38,000 --> 00:40:43,000
 I think we're at this pivotal moment on the Kingdom calendar

682
00:40:43,000 --> 00:40:47,000
 when Joshua was about to go in.

683
00:40:47,000 --> 00:40:48,000
